\n3. Controller/mouse UI, title/attract, town, dev sliders, procedural audio.\\\\n4. Couch co-op and shared-world Hub integration.\\\\n5. One test command including full playthrough and browser/Hub tests.\\\\n6. Final bundle, About feedback, exit-interview.json, cleanup.\\\\n\\\\n## Verification\\\\nNot run yet.\\\\n''')\nprint(json.dumps({'title':name,'devFolder':base}))\nPY\"","aggregated_output":"{\"title\": \"Diabellum\", \"devFolder\": \"Diabellum-Diablo 3-gpt-6.1-sol-max-20261105-103438\"}\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
