{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_44","type":"agent_message","text":"The four heroes now have custom weapons and procedural animation. The game also has a controller-navigable panel system, town services, crafting, Relics, and the Long Vigil loop. Next I’m connecting the menus and Hub session adapter to the runtime, then testing the full build.\n"}}
