{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_47","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"python3 - <<'PY'\nfrom pathlib import Path\np=Path('PROGRESS.md');s=p.read_text();s=s.replace('- Fetch and read engine/API and Hub protocol.','- Engine and Hub documentation read. Engine is v0.89.1; Hub client is 1.4.0.\\\\n- Implemented modular data for four heroes, 32 skills x 3 Tones, 24 Relics, sets, monsters, affixes, zones, bosses, story and attract vignettes.\\\\n- Implemented deterministic world/combat/bot, loot, town services, campaign, Vigil, procedural art/audio, canvas UI, menus, Dev Mode and Hub adapter.\\\\n- Bundle/build script writes the named root HTML and exit interview.\\\\n- Current focus: boot and simulation verification, then browser/Hub testing and visual fixes.');s += '\\\\n## Known verification findings\\\\n- Early simulation found an unreachable town exit inside a building; moved the exit.\\\\n- Fixed world event kind collisions and native texture color arguments before first full boot.\\\\n- Need to verify final held Tongue interaction, quest progression, all skills/Tones, UI input and networking.\\\\n';p.write_text(s)\nPY\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
