{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_110","type":"agent_message","text":"The broader render pass found a town bug that the initial browser checks missed: a portal glow call used the wrong renderer signature and could stop the frame from drawing. I’m fixing it and adding a direct regression check. I’m also tightening the couch revival path so each player can rise independently.\n"}}
