{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_129","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"python3 - <<'PY'\nfrom pathlib import Path\np=Path('PROGRESS.md');s=p.read_text();s+='''\\\\n## Final verification and last fixes\\\\n- All 14 viewport profiles, all zones, all three bosses in every phase, all custom panels and four attack filmstrips have been generated by the unified browser suite. Images are under \"'`check-output/`.'\"\\\\n- A wider visual test caught a wrong \"'`r.glowDisc` signature in visible portals. Removed that call; the existing lights and portal rings supply the effect. Added a direct portal draw regression.'\"\\\\n- Added independent couch revival, preserved couch character saves, monotonic item IDs on reload, and cached town-portal room state so returning neither resets objectives nor skips quests.\\\\n- Fixed a furniture penny-source regression caught by the new ranged-furniture test.\\\\n- Latest full pass before that regression: 3075 passed / 1 failed; the remaining failure was the extended network fixture competing with harness random movement. The fixture now blocks harness movement and uses its own controlled actions. Four required Hub scenarios still passed.\\\\n- Added behavior checks for real attack cadence, secondary attacks while holding primary, socket effects and room persistence.\\\\n- Current work: finish fresh full test run, inspect final screenshots/filmstrips, write final test report, remove temporary scripts and \"'`_repo`, rebuild and validate paperwork.'\"\\\\n''';p.write_text(s)\nPY\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_129","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"python3 - <<'PY'\nfrom pathlib import Path\np=Path('PROGRESS.md');s=p.read_text();s+='''\\\\n## Final verification and last fixes\\\\n- All 14 viewport profiles, all zones, all three bosses in every phase, all custom panels and four attack filmstrips have been generated by the unified browser suite. Images are under \"'`check-output/`.'\"\\\\n- A wider visual test caught a wrong \"'`r.glowDisc` signature in visible portals. Removed that call; the existing lights and portal rings supply the effect. Added a direct portal draw regression.'\"\\\\n- Added independent couch revival, preserved couch character saves, monotonic item IDs on reload, and cached town-portal room state so returning neither resets objectives nor skips quests.\\\\n- Fixed a furniture penny-source regression caught by the new ranged-furniture test.\\\\n- Latest full pass before that regression: 3075 passed / 1 failed; the remaining failure was the extended network fixture competing with harness random movement. The fixture now blocks harness movement and uses its own controlled actions. Four required Hub scenarios still passed.\\\\n- Added behavior checks for real attack cadence, secondary attacks while holding primary, socket effects and room persistence.\\\\n- Current work: finish fresh full test run, inspect final screenshots/filmstrips, write final test report, remove temporary scripts and \"'`_repo`, rebuild and validate paperwork.'\"\\\\n''';p.write_text(s)\nPY\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
