{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_151","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"python3 - <<'PY'\nfrom pathlib import Path\nimport json\np=Path('package-lock.json');d=json.loads(p.read_text());d['name']='diabellum';d['version']='1.0.0';d['packages']['']['name']='diabellum';d['packages']['']['version']='1.0.0';p.write_text(json.dumps(d,indent=2)+'\\\\n')\np=Path('README.md');s=p.read_text().replace('Select a suite with \"'`node tools/test.mjs data`, `sim`, `play`, `browser` or `hub`.'\"', 'Select a suite with \"'`node tools/test.mjs data`, `sim`, `play`, `browser` or `hub`; comma-separated names run a chosen group.'\"');p.write_text(s)\np=Path('PROGRESS.md');s=p.read_text();s+='''\\\\n## Handoff preparation\\\\n- Latest selected run: data, campaign UI/playthrough, browser + 14 viewports + all scene/panel/phase captures, and Hub all passed (2659 checks before the final lore placement adjustment). The simulation suite separately passed 428 checks.\\\\n- Twelve distinct lore pages now have explicit, reachable world placements; data lint asserts coverage. Updated data/play/browser run passed 2656 checks.\\\\n- Phone screenshot capture now waits for an actual title frame; regenerated images show the game rather than its boot overlay.\\\\n- Added release guards so closing a pad menu with Circle cannot also cast its combat skill. A regression checks this.\\\\n- Engine SHA-256 matched the fetched v0.89.1 handoff exactly; no engine edits. Removed the 153 MB \"'`_repo` clone and temporary diagnostic scripts.'\"\\\\n- Final full \"'`node tools/test.mjs` run is active. Wait for its result before declaring completion. Then inspect regenerated contact sheets and filmstrips, write TESTING.md, validate final HTML/interview, and finish.'\"\\\\n''';p.write_text(s)\nPY\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
