{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_169","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"python3 - <<'PY'\nfrom pathlib import Path\nimport json\np=Path('../PROGRESS.md');s=p.read_text();s=s.replace('# Progress\\\\n','# Progress\\\\n\\\\nStatus: complete.\\\\n',1);s+='''\\\\n## Completed handoff\\\\n- Built and delivered the root single-file Diabellum HTML and \"'`exit-interview.json`, using the exact TASK.md basename.'\"\\\\n- Full unified command passed: **3097 checks, 3097 passed, zero failed**.\\\\n- Final focused browser run passed **45/45**, including keyboard skills retaining mouse aim. Final data/package validation passed **2535/2535**.\\\\n- The corrected matrix was recaptured after the boot overlay closed and all fourteen PNGs were inspected. Inspected all zone/boss/menu contact sheets and all four seven-frame attack filmstrips.\\\\n- Inspected final mouse HUD, personal couch-loot markers and skill cost/cooldown presentation; no browser errors.\\\\n- About/Credits and exit interview share the completed source information and feedback. JSON shape, all required values, title, basename, unmodified first Hub script, inline-only scripts and the MIT notice were checked.\\\\n- \"'`TESTING.md` records coverage and ten tracked defects (four potentially game breaking), all corrected. `game/CONTENT.md` is the designer guide.'\"\\\\n- Temporary clone and diagnostic scripts removed; only owned temporary servers/browsers were used and closed.\\\\n- Scope: a condensed complete campaign plus Vigil. Optional mocap clips and WebGPU lighting omitted; native canvas lighting is used.\\\\n- No remaining implementation or handoff work.\\\\n''';p.write_text(s)\np=Path('TESTING.md');s=p.read_text().replace('Packaging was rebuilt after adding the engine\\\\'s MIT notice.', 'Final visual captures also check compact mouse labels, co-op loot ownership/resource bars, and skill cost/cooldown text. Packaging was rebuilt after adding the engine\\\\'s MIT notice.');p.write_text(s)\nroot=Path('..');cfg=json.loads(Path('build-config.json').read_text());d=json.loads((root/'exit-interview.json').read_text());assert d['sourceInformation']['date']=='2026-11-05 10:34:38';assert all(isinstance(v,str) and v for v in d['sourceInformation'].values());assert d['sourceInformation']['usage']=='added on import';assert d['aiHub']['name']==cfg['title'];assert len(d['testingFeedback'])==4 and len(d['engineFeedback'])==6 and len(d['promptFeedback'])==4;assert (root/(cfg['base']+'.html')).exists();assert Path.cwd().name==cfg['base'];assert not Path('_repo').exists();print(json.dumps({'html':cfg['base']+'.html','bytes':(root/(cfg['base']+'.html')).stat().st_size,'interview':'valid','progress':'complete'}))\nPY\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_169","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"python3 - <<'PY'\nfrom pathlib import Path\nimport json\np=Path('../PROGRESS.md');s=p.read_text();s=s.replace('# Progress\\\\n','# Progress\\\\n\\\\nStatus: complete.\\\\n',1);s+='''\\\\n## Completed handoff\\\\n- Built and delivered the root single-file Diabellum HTML and \"'`exit-interview.json`, using the exact TASK.md basename.'\"\\\\n- Full unified command passed: **3097 checks, 3097 passed, zero failed**.\\\\n- Final focused browser run passed **45/45**, including keyboard skills retaining mouse aim. Final data/package validation passed **2535/2535**.\\\\n- The corrected matrix was recaptured after the boot overlay closed and all fourteen PNGs were inspected. Inspected all zone/boss/menu contact sheets and all four seven-frame attack filmstrips.\\\\n- Inspected final mouse HUD, personal couch-loot markers and skill cost/cooldown presentation; no browser errors.\\\\n- About/Credits and exit interview share the completed source information and feedback. JSON shape, all required values, title, basename, unmodified first Hub script, inline-only scripts and the MIT notice were checked.\\\\n- \"'`TESTING.md` records coverage and ten tracked defects (four potentially game breaking), all corrected. `game/CONTENT.md` is the designer guide.'\"\\\\n- Temporary clone and diagnostic scripts removed; only owned temporary servers/browsers were used and closed.\\\\n- Scope: a condensed complete campaign plus Vigil. Optional mocap clips and WebGPU lighting omitted; native canvas lighting is used.\\\\n- No remaining implementation or handoff work.\\\\n''';p.write_text(s)\np=Path('TESTING.md');s=p.read_text().replace('Packaging was rebuilt after adding the engine\\\\'s MIT notice.', 'Final visual captures also check compact mouse labels, co-op loot ownership/resource bars, and skill cost/cooldown text. Packaging was rebuilt after adding the engine\\\\'s MIT notice.');p.write_text(s)\nroot=Path('..');cfg=json.loads(Path('build-config.json').read_text());d=json.loads((root/'exit-interview.json').read_text());assert d['sourceInformation']['date']=='2026-11-05 10:34:38';assert all(isinstance(v,str) and v for v in d['sourceInformation'].values());assert d['sourceInformation']['usage']=='added on import';assert d['aiHub']['name']==cfg['title'];assert len(d['testingFeedback'])==4 and len(d['engineFeedback'])==6 and len(d['promptFeedback'])==4;assert (root/(cfg['base']+'.html')).exists();assert Path.cwd().name==cfg['base'];assert not Path('_repo').exists();print(json.dumps({'html':cfg['base']+'.html','bytes':(root/(cfg['base']+'.html')).stat().st_size,'interview':'valid','progress':'complete'}))\nPY\"","aggregated_output":"{\"html\": \"Diabellum-Diablo 3-gpt-6.1-sol-max-20261105-103438.html\", \"bytes\": 1529130, \"interview\": \"valid\", \"progress\": \"complete\"}\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_170","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"node --input-type=module - <<'JS'\nimport{chromium}from'playwright';import fs from'node:fs';import path from'node:path';import{pathToFileURL}from'node:url';const cfg=JSON.parse(fs.readFileSync('build-config.json','utf8'));const b=await chromium.launch({headless:true});try{const p=await b.newPage({viewport:{width:1920,height:1080}});await p.goto(pathToFileURL(path.resolve('..',cfg.base+'.html')).href+'#zone/nave');await p.waitForFunction(()=>window.__diabellum?.game.sceneName==='play');await p.waitForFunction(()=>document.getElementById('e3-boot').hidden);await p.evaluate(()=>{const a=__diabellum,w=a.world,h=w.heroes[0];a.CHEATS.god=true;a.CHEATS.freezeAI=true;w.zoneCard=0;w.dialogue=null;w.toasts=[];a.talk.close();const p=a.newHero('cantor',1,h.level);p.x=h.x+28;p.y=h.y+10;w.heroes.push(p);a.dropItem(w,h,h.x-20,h.y,{rarity:4,relic:'ossian'});a.dropItem(w,p,p.x+20,p.y,{rarity:4,relic:'drowned'});w.dialogue=null;a.talk.close();});await p.waitForTimeout(200);await p.screenshot({path:'check-output/scenes/couch-loot.png'});await p.evaluate(()=>__diabellum.openPanel('skills'));await p.waitForTimeout(100);await p.screenshot({path:'check-output/scenes/skill-costs.png'});console.log(JSON.stringify(await p.evaluate(()=>({finalRenderErrors:__diabellum.game.errors.length}))));}finally{await b.close();}\nJS\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
